Thanks for pointing out. The name is fetched from this function:
```js
function getComponentName (opts: ?VNodeComponentOptions): ?string {
  return opts && (opts.Ctor.options.name || opts.tag)
}
```
Since the `options.name` is not required and `opt.tag` is optional: 
```js
export interface VNodeComponentOptions {
  Ctor: typeof Vue;
  propsData?: object;
  listeners?: object;
  children?: VNode[];
  tag?: string;
}
```
so here I use `toString` for double check.

